 "床相伴，忙碌的心安。冷日常，温柔岁月。", "identityId": "2032205959382077442", "identityType": 22, "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "address": "积累生活，坚定的前行。沉。", "visitCount": 1, "exchangeStatus": -1, "cardType": 30, "contactId": null, "ipArea": null, "persionalIntroduce": "每天闲聊家人，让平凡的日子多了几分新。偶完成空雨伞，感受生活的小美好。喜欢夕记录桥的感觉，简单又脏。 (stay true to yourself)热茶水的美好，在于细细地擦拭的过程，而非匆匆的结果。认真地盼舒适的影，感受生活的小美好。喜欢暖炖眼镜。", "isMine": false, "isOfficial": false, "cardShareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260313/05df0e7c8c37aa5dd5c12ed5fa018091c5b80f868d1e8c1e9cbe3c1217fc7fa4.png", "memberStatus": null, "memberExpireDate": null, "cardId": "2032205870988787712", "userInfo": {"id": null, "avatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/freeu-card/common/default-avatar.png", "name": "靓时", "sex": null, "mobile": "14573537986", "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "address": "积累生活，坚定的前行。沉。", "wechat": null, "nativePlace": null, "nativePlaceName": null, "nativePlaceCode": null, "memberStatus": null, "memberExpireDate": null}, "groupId": "1961029032266903553", "receiveStatus": 0, "initialsGrouped": null, "followed": false}, {"id": "2032205437774237697", "userId": null, "name": "偶香散", "mobile": "13600504716", "avatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/freeu-card/common/default-avatar.png", "tag1": "上海市人工智能学会", "tag2": "执行副秘书长", "identityId": "2032205438134947841", "identityType": 22, "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "address": "上海市", "visitCount": 0, "exchangeStatus": -1, "cardType": 30, "contactId": null, "ipArea": null, "persionalIntroduce": "上海福芮柚科技有限公司创始人，《FreeTrust》创造者，上海市人工智能学会执行副秘书长，北京大学2025级法律系学生。公众号：FreeTrust商务社交圈。", "isMine": false, "isOfficial": false, "cardShareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260313/5a5c7de47073e4b60be16773937498ac16f2e9b05368ebd17b21e1ff85f76cc7.png", "memberStatus": null, "memberExpireDate": null, "cardId": "2032205437648408578", "userInfo": {"id": null, "avatar": "htt